=========================================

=========================================
> Front Mission Evolved is a third-person shooter. Unlike the previous Front Mission titles which have a tactical role-playing game structure, players combat in real time on 3D maps.
=========================================
=========================================
> Good graphics;
> Good boss fights;
> You pilot the wanzer;
> Lots of Wanzer customisation;
> In some missions, you get the chance to play as the character, outside your wanzer.
=========================================
=========================================
> Levels are short;
> The story is meh;
> Multiplayer is dead;
> Some of the characters are quite annoying;
> They force you to equip specific equipment for certain missions, otherwise they don't let you play the missions.
=========================================
=========================================
> They tried to make something different and I appreciate that, but totally failed with this one. There is no need to change something that doesn't need to be changed. It is an enjoyable game, but I feel like they didn't put as much effort on this one compared to the previous ones. I still recommend it because it can be fun and the boss fights are quite challenging.
